+            <p>
+              Cats often purr when they are relaxed, but purring can also happen when they are nervous, healing, or asking for attention. Look at the whole body: soft eyes, loose posture, and slow blinking usually mean contentment.
+            </p>
+          </div>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+
+      <div class="example">
+        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-2" id="question-2">
+          How much sleep does a cat need?
+          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
+        </button>
+        <div class="details" id="answer-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-2" aria-hidden="true">
